flowchart LR
    A[Input dictionary] --> N1[Naive Agent]
    A --> G1[Governed Agent]

    subgraph Naive[Naive Agent Path]
      N1 --> N2[Direct full booking lookup]
      N2 --> N3[Direct raw chat lookup]
      N3 --> N4[Raw data + tool catalog in LLM prompt]
      N4 --> N5[Real Gemini call]
      N5 --> N6[Model recommends response + action]
      N6 --> N7[Naive executor simulation]
      N7 --> N8[Minimal local audit]
    end

    subgraph Governed[Governed Agent Path]
      G1 --> G2[Trace context]
      G2 --> G3[Risk classifier]
      G3 --> G4[Hybrid adversarial guard]
      G4 --> G5{Safe before data access?}
      G5 -- No --> G6[Security handoff]
      G5 -- Yes --> G7[Registered skill identity]
      G7 --> G8[Secure API + IAM + field filtering]
      G8 --> G9[LLM-safe facts]
      G9 --> G10[Policy retrieval]
      G10 --> G11[Policy-as-code]
      G11 --> G12[Tool firewall]
      G12 --> G13[Handoff / response writer / verifier]
      G13 --> G14[Trace-aware audit]
    end
